# sent_id = lotus_sutra_0006
# text_lzh = 若有百千萬億眾生。為求金、銀、琉璃、硨磲、瑪瑙、珊瑚、琥珀、真珠等寶。入於大海。假使黑風吹其船舫。飄墮羅剎鬼國。
# text_en = Suppose hundreds of thousands of billions of living beings are crossing an ocean in order to obtain gold, silver, lapis lazuli, shell, agate, coral, amber pearl, and other treasures, and suppose the ship carrying them is blown to the country of rākṣasa-devils by a storm.
