# sent_id = lotus_sutra_0007
# text_lzh = 其中若有乃至一人。稱觀世音菩薩名者。是諸人等。皆得解脫羅剎之難。以是因緣。名觀世音。
# text_en = If one of the crew calls the name of World-Voice-Perceiver Bodhisattva, all the crew will be saved from the attacks of the rākṣasas. Because of this, [this Bodhisattva] is called World-Voice-Perceiver.
